            <title>[KYLIN-5712] The database, table, column name in the model creation API are case-sensitive, resulting in an error when calling the API</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KYLIN-5712</link>
                <project id="12316121" key="KYLIN">Kylin</project>
