                            <comment id="17786623" author="JIRAUSER303052" created="Thu, 16 Nov 2023 05:50:55 +0000"  >&lt;h2&gt;&lt;a name=&quot;DevDesign&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;Dev Design&lt;/h2&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Currently kylin metadata about library table columns are in uppercase, so converting case sensitive input parameters to uppercase can avoid errors.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;The api inputs are based on the ModelRequest class and include the following fields that need to be converted to uppercase:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;blockquote&gt;&lt;p&gt;fact_table&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;simplified_dimensions#column&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;join_tables#table&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;join_tables#join#foreign_key&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;join_tables#join#primary_key&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;join_tables#join#simplified_non_equi_join_conditions#foreign_key&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;join_tables#join#simplified_non_equi_join_conditions#primary_key&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Other open api&apos;s that use ModelRequest as an input:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;post /comments_synchronization synchronization comments&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
